{
  "EpisodeId": 1050114,
  "StoryType": 1,
  "Order": 14,
  "Prev": 1050113,
  "Next": 1050115,
  "Chapter": "最终章",
  "Title": "被遗忘之神的恸哭与饥渴",
  "EpisodeDetail": [
    {
      "Id": 1050114001,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050114,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 1,
      "SpeakerName": "观众们",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "「下一个剧团是……Eden？」「听说前阵子还拿了欧洲的奖」/n「《被遗忘之神的恸哭与饥渴》……这个标题有点让人在意呢」",
      "BackgroundImageFileName": "2220",
      "BgmFileName": "5",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501140010",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050114002,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050114,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 2,
      "SpeakerName": "審査員Ｉ",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "接下来是Eden……率领这个剧团的连尺野初魅，/n可以说是演剧界的异端。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501140020",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050114003,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050114,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 3,
      "SpeakerName": "審査員Ｊ",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "哦，所以Horoscope Season的时候，她才会无视我的通知？/n呵呵……倒是挺有意思，不过她真的有与之相称的实力吗？",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501140030",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050114004,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050114,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 4,
      "SpeakerName": "審査員Ｋ",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "不过，这可是有过获得「普罗米修斯奖」实绩的剧团。/n凭我的直觉……这个剧团不简单。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501140040",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050114005,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050114,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 5,
      "SpeakerName": "審査員Ｊ",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "你看起来很期待嘛。那就让我们见识一下吧。/n看看她们是否真有值得你如此看好的光芒。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501140050",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050114006,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050114,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 6,
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "",
      "BackgroundImageFileFadeType": 1,
      "BgmFileName": "405",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "FadeValue1": 0.20000000298023224,
      "FadeValue2": 0.30000001192092896,
      "FadeValue3": 0.20000000298023224
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050114007,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050114,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 7,
      "SpeakerName": "初魅",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "「这里是哪里。我……又是谁……。/n　什么都不知道。难道我把一切都忘了吗……」",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501140060",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "201"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050114008,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050114,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 8,
      "SpeakerName": "初魅",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "「……对了，我想起来了。/n　我一直在旅行，寻找自己的名字。」",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501140070",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "201"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050114009,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050114,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 9,
      "SpeakerName": "容",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "「要我给你带路吗？」",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501140080",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "204"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050114010,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050114,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 10,
      "SpeakerName": "初魅",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "「……你是谁。」",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501140090",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "201"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050114011,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050114,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 11,
      "SpeakerName": "容",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "「我是金牛座。我知道你想去的地方。/n　放心吧，我以前还背过一位神界的贵妇呢！」",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501140100",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "204"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050114012,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050114,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 12,
      "SpeakerName": "初魅",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "「为什么所有人都叫我乌拉诺斯？/n　我根本不叫那个名字。别用那个名字叫我！」",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501140110",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "201"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050114013,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050114,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 13,
      "SpeakerName": "初魅",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "「……这是怎么回事？每次听见那个名字，我心里都会涌起愤怒。/n　甚至想把一切都破坏掉……！」",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501140120",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "201"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050114014,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050114,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 14,
      "SpeakerName": "初魅",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "「为什么……我……」",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501140130",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "201"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050114015,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050114,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 15,
      "SpeakerName": "観客Ａ",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "（主演那种愤怒和困惑……仿佛连我都能真切感受到……！）",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501140140",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050114016,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050114,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 16,
      "SpeakerName": "観客Ｂ",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "（金牛座的演员也很好。/n　正因为有她的演技，才让主演的悲壮感更加突出了……）",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501140150",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050114017,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050114,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 17,
      "SpeakerName": "審査員Ｋ",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "（…………。/n　在正统的世界演剧联盟上，居然选择这种残酷的主题。）",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501140160",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050114018,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050114,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 18,
      "SpeakerName": "審査員Ｋ",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "（……除了「前所未有」，实在想不到别的形容。）",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501140170",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050114019,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050114,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 19,
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "",
      "BackgroundImageFileFadeType": 1,
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "FadeValue1": 0.20000000298023224,
      "FadeValue2": 0.30000001192092896,
      "FadeValue3": 0.20000000298023224
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050114020,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050114,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 20,
      "SpeakerName": "初魅",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "「我的真正名字是『凶星』……曾经是声名显赫的神，/n　却因为被人们遗忘，神格扭曲后落得如此下场。」",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501140180",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "201"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050114021,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050114,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 21,
      "SpeakerName": "初魅",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "「吞噬无数星辰的怪物……那就是我？怎么会……。/n　可是，这些记忆确实……啊啊……！我究竟都做了什么……！」",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501140190",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "201"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050114022,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050114,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 22,
      "SpeakerName": "容",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "「如果这里不是你的容身之处，那就一起去找吧。」",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501140200",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "204"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050114023,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050114,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 23,
      "SpeakerName": "容",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "「这世上一定有那么一个地方，愿意接纳你的存在。/n　世界这么大，总会有的。」",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501140210",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "204"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050114024,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050114,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 24,
      "SpeakerName": "容",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "「来，抬起头吧。我也陪你一起去。」",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501140220",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "204"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050114025,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050114,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 25,
      "SpeakerName": "容",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "「为了寻找你如今留在这里的理由——/n　不再是神，也不再是怪物的你。」",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501140230",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "204"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050114026,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050114,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 26,
      "SpeakerName": "初魅",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "「嗯……。/n　…………谢谢你。」",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501140240",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "201"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050114027,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050114,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 27,
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "",
      "BackgroundImageFileFadeType": 1,
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "FadeValue1": 0.20000000298023224,
      "FadeValue2": 0.30000001192092896,
      "FadeValue3": 0.20000000298023224
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050114028,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050114,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 28,
      "SpeakerName": "评审们",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "……。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501140250",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050114029,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050114,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 29,
      "SpeakerName": "審査員Ｊ",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "（先锋大胆的演出，加上扎实可靠的演技，共同构成了如此厚重的舞台……/n　用那种题材居然能做出这种成品……说实话，我很震惊。）",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501140260",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050114030,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050114,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 30,
      "SpeakerName": "審査員Ｉ",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "……乍看之下荒诞离奇又残酷，中途更换主演、偏离既定剧本，/n这些打破常规的做法，稍有不慎甚至会被视为一种冒犯。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501140270",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050114031,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050114,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 31,
      "SpeakerName": "審査員Ｉ",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "但这仍是一场让人不得不给予肯定的舞台。/n所有演出设计都经过缜密打磨，每一位演员都各自闪耀……那是个奇妙的瞬间。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501140280",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050114032,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050114,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 32,
      "SpeakerName": "審査員Ｉ",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "说实话，除了赞美我想不到其他词……这是一场非常精彩的舞台。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501140290",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050114033,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050114,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 33,
      "SpeakerName": "初魅",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "承蒙夸奖，不胜感激。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501140300",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 71,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 3,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 20103,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "201"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050114034,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050114,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 34,
      "SpeakerName": "審査員Ｋ",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "正因如此，我才想问……你为什么要站上这个舞台？",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501140310",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050114035,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050114,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 35,
      "SpeakerName": "審査員Ｋ",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "你们特意选择呈现这样的舞台……。/n而这场舞台、你们的演技，难道不是在试图传达什么吗？",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501140320",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050114036,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050114,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 36,
      "SpeakerName": "審査員Ｋ",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "……你应该有些话想在这里说吧？/n责任由我这个评审代表来承担……尽管说吧。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501140330",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050114037,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050114,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 37,
      "SpeakerName": "初魅",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "（不愧是名演员……果然都被看穿了。）",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501140340",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 100,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 3,
          "SpineId": 20103,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "201"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050114038,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050114,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 38,
      "SpeakerName": "初魅",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "我……要对你们所塑造出的Sense至上风潮提出异议。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501140350",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 107,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 4,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "201"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050114039,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050114,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 39,
      "SpeakerName": "初魅",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "真正的舞台，必须让演出设计、道具、灯光等一切元素，/n都与演员的演技相互连接、彼此强化，才能最终完成。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501140360",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 74,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 4,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "201"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050114040,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050114,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 40,
      "SpeakerName": "初魅",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "Sense不过是其中的附加要素。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501140370",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 107,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 21,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 4,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "201"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050114041,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050114,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 41,
      "SpeakerName": "初魅",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "可你们塑造出了将它奉为至上的价值观……。/n这对所有演员来说，都已经变成了噪音。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501140380",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 73,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 14,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 4,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "201"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050114042,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050114,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 42,
      "SpeakerName": "初魅",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "现在，我们在此向你们宣战！/n我们必将打破由你们亲手塑造出的那尊虚像！",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501140390",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 101,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 2,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "201"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1050114043,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1050114,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 43,
      "SpeakerName": "審査員Ｋ",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "原来如此……是吗，居然会这样出招。/n看来我的直觉果然没错……你们真有意思。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10501140400",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    }
  ]
}